meta {
  name: Diagnostics - Dry Run
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/workspaces/:workspace/workflows/:workflow/dry-run
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  workspace: {{workspaceId}}
  workflow: {{workflowId}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "input": {
      "customer_email": "buyer@example.com"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Walks the graph without executing anything for real — no side effects, no
  credits. Requires the `workflow.manage` permission.

  Takes the same optional `graph` as `Diagnostics - Validate` (omit it to
  dry-run the saved draft), plus:

  - `input` — optional array standing in for the run input the graph would
    receive, so `{{ input.* }}` templates resolve against something real.

  Answers `200` with the trace regardless of what it finds.

  Response is wrapped:
  `{ success, statusCode, message, data: { dry_run } }`.
}
